150","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2026年10月11日 https://t.co/Z5h9idVvk9 来自 @YouTube\n\n禅门公案 第一集\n\n《黄檗禅师：即心是佛》\n\n唐代，有一位著名的禅宗大师，\n名叫黄檗希运禅师。\n\n他留下了一部重要的禅宗典籍，\n叫做《传心法要》。\n\n有一天，弟子请问禅师：\n\n“师父，什么是佛？”\n\n黄檗禅师回答：\n\n“即心是佛，无心是道。”","url":"https://x.com/sun780500/status/2109062584162992150"},{"author_id":"2108505586526740480","created_at":"2026-10-11T13:12:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109270992602480727"],"id":"2109270992602480727","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":18,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"地藏菩萨本愿经浅释\n\n忉利天宫神通品第一\n\n     宣化上人","url":"https://x.com/yongfreeg8/status/2109270992602480727"},{"author_id":"1879736704128716800","created_at":"2026-10-11T00:46:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109083232126013461"],"id":"2109083232126013461","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2026年10月11日 https://t.co/yfdlgvttsn 来自 @YouTube\n禅门公案 第四集\n\n《赵州狗子无佛性：\n为什么禅师只说一个“无”字？》\n\n唐代，有一位著名的禅宗大师，\n名叫赵州从谂禅师。\n\n他留下了一则千古公案，\n叫做《狗子无佛性》。\n\n有一天，\n一位僧人来到赵州禅师面前，\n恭敬地请问：","url":"https://x.com/sun780500/status/2109083232126013461"},{"author_id":"1452505528106569729","created_at":"2026-10-12T14:21:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109650545652969574"],"id":"2109650545652969574","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4334,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"给大家科普一下：\n\n金庸小说里有个人，叫岳不群。\n\n这个人特别牛逼，江湖人称「君子剑」，天天满嘴仁义道德，一副正人君子的模样。\n\n但是岳不群一直有一个梦想：\n\n成为天下第一，实现弯道超车。\n\n后来偷偷搞到了林家的《辟邪剑谱》，结果发现一个惊天秘密：\n\n欲练神功，必先自宫。\n\n卧槽，卧槽，卧槽。","url":"https://x.com/xiaoshunli/status/2109650545652969574"},{"author_id":"754318781237850117","created_at":"2026-10-11T04:29:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109139232929595823"],"id":"2109139232929595823","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_c