t":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近沉迷于缠论，结构出来自带K线美学啊。自己开发了一个缠论的变种。#K线美学 #缠论 https://t.co/emnzf0jSmp","url":"https://x.com/GalenJoe2/status/2109743162428363128"},{"article":{"title":"禅宗：一个说\"不立文字\"、却留下了最多文字的宗派"},"author_id":"2869390354","created_at":"2026-10-12T07:30:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109547252855476258"],"id":"2109547252855476258","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2544,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/RkSfNSGOhd","url":"https://x.com/jhdxhl/status/2109547252855476258"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109093108390776832"]},"author_id":"1910907485554462720","created_at":"2026-10-11T01:26:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109093284048163229"],"id":"2109093284048163229","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":62,"impression_count":7293,"like_count":86,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":10},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2098071765016842314","type":"quoted"}],"text":"看见涨，怕错过；看见跌，想抄底。\n折腾半天，却说不清：自己到底在做哪一段行情。\n所以，花姐准备开一个专栏：\n\n《花姐带路，100天搞懂缠论》\n\n每天一张图，只拆一个知识点。\n\n从怎么看一根 K 线开始，把分型、笔、线段、中枢这些听着绕嘴的词，翻译成能听懂的大白话。 https://t.co/GLHwOlLj2l https://t.co/EZkEn6m5rH","url":"https://x.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2109093284048163229"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109443649356673024","3_2109443649327312896"]},"author_id":"1687661863193264128","created_at":"2026-10-12T00:38:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109443661218066495"],"id":"2109443661218066495","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":130,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"凌晨的暴跌洗盘刚结束，比特币现在又悄悄摸回了 83,840 附近。看了下盘面，多空博弈非常精彩！\n🔴 【15分钟线】：MACD水下金叉后红柱持续放量，均线多头排列，短线明显有资金在托底。24小时高点 84,200 是短期需要突破的阻力。\n🔵 https://t.co/id73sWVLFF","url":"https://x.com/lxp720803/status/2109443661218066495"},{"author_id":"1646964117763235840","created_at":"2026-10-12T03:01:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109479437553316138"],"id":"2109479437553316138","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1157,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109312609694691601","type":"quoted"}],"text":"研究缠论还是挺有帮助。我也就学了点皮毛，至少对大趋势的理解很有帮助。现在有了AI，让AI辅助你理解。\n缠论整个体系归根结底：\n价格什么时候在“缠”（震荡），什么时候在“不缠”（趋势）。 https://t.co/gaSoXackZB","url":"https://x.com/ErikWilcox91338/status/2109479437553316138"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2109577959132766208","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109297175717187586","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109615945216106496","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109742828738002944","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109093108390776832","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109443649356673024","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2109443649327312896","type":"photo"}],"users":[{"id":"925446092669489154","name":"Peter Liu, PhD｜Wealth & Wellness","username":"InGodWeBelieveU"},{"id":"1592938896161001472","name":"Crypto以缠解势","username":"yycl_gaoshan"},{"id":"1747688478907805697","name":"林白知识分享","username":"linbai363"},{"id":"1317556504992632834","name":"кирилл","username":"iWYROxvxv0QfgQN"},{"id":"935001155570057217","name":"王佐","username":"wangzuobazi01"},{"id":"1316966018674089985","name":"kenclothingco.","username":"kenclothing1"},{"id":"146860563","name":"白萝卜不白","username":"Cizarrin"},{"id":"2108505586526740480","name":"孟橄榄","username":"yongfreeg8"},{"id":"166248328","name":"Kirsten Scholtz","username":"kirstypop2"},{"id":"1443070699459989505","name":"WoodFireWater","username":"0xJunJun"},{"id":"2073035346707968000","name":"Yifan Xu","username":"yifanxu_ephai"},{"id":"1879736704128716800","name":"與佛同行 Walking with the Buddha","username":"sun780500"},{"id":"1452505528106569729","name":"大顺利","username":"xiaoshunli"},{"id":"754318781237850117","name":"Pınar yücetepe","username":"p_yucetepe"},{"id":"906748052718837760","name":"Jessica Ballesteros","username":"Jessica82017059"},{"id":"1536613494715404288","name":"Morgan🇭🇰","username":"GalenJoe2"},{"id":"2869390354","name":"Fox","username":"jhd